# New UNERA V2 Brand — Output & Standards

Any page, screen, or component built with the **new UNERA V2 brand guidelines** (March 2026 PDF) must follow these rules.

## Output Folder

All new-brand files go in `NewUnera/` (project root). Never edit or overwrite the production root files (`dashboard-enhanced.html`, `wallet-enhanced.html`, etc.) with new brand styles.

```
NewUnera/
  brand-style-guide.html
  dashboard-enhanced.html
  wallet-enhanced.html
  (any future new-brand screens here)
```

## Typography

Use **TestFoundersGrotesk** via `@font-face` (local OTF files in `Brand Guide/`). Never import Space Grotesk or any Google Font for new-brand pages.

```css
@font-face {
    font-family: 'TestFoundersGrotesk';
    src: url('../Brand Guide/TestFoundersGrotesk-Regular.otf') format('opentype');
    font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-display: swap;
}
/* Repeat for Light (300), Medium (500), Semibold (600), Bold (700) and matching Italics */
```

Font stack: `--font-display: 'TestFoundersGrotesk', 'Oakes Grotesk', sans-serif;`

## Color Tokens (`:root` — use exactly)

```css
:root {
    --brand-deep-blue:   #173d47;
    --brand-yellow:      #ffffab;
    --brand-cloud-blue:  #ebfcf5;
    --brand-earth:       #cec4b8;
    --brand-black:       #000000;
    --brand-white:       #ffffff;
    --brand-red:         #ab5770;
    --brand-purple:      #6a5770;
    --brand-light-blue:  #8bacb1;

    --primary:           var(--brand-deep-blue);
    --accent:            var(--brand-yellow);
    --surface:           var(--brand-white);
    --text-primary:      var(--brand-deep-blue);
    --text-secondary:    #3d6b78;
    --border-subtle:     rgba(23, 61, 71, 0.15);

    --gradient-primary:  linear-gradient(135deg, #173d47 0%, #6a5770 100%);
    --gradient-warm:     linear-gradient(135deg, #cec4b8 0%, #ffffab 100%);
    --gradient-sky:      linear-gradient(135deg, #ebfcf5 0%, #8bacb1 100%);

    --success:  #173d47;
    --warning:  #b8a030;
    --error:    var(--brand-red);

    --font-display: 'TestFoundersGrotesk', 'Oakes Grotesk', sans-serif;
    --font-body:    'TestFoundersGrotesk', 'Oakes Grotesk', sans-serif;
}
```

## Key Design Patterns

- **Nav**: Deep Blue background (`#173d47`), white links, Yellow (`#ffffab`) active/hover state
- **Page background**: Cloud Blue (`#ebfcf5`)
- **Primary button**: Deep Blue fill, white text
- **Accent button**: Yellow fill (`#ffffab`), Deep Blue text
- **Cards**: white surface, `border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle)`, `border-radius: 1.25rem`
- **Focus ring**: `outline: 2px solid var(--brand-deep-blue); outline-offset: 2px`
- **Gradient text** (page titles): `background: var(--gradient-primary); -webkit-background-clip: text`

## What NOT to Do

- ❌ Never use `#10B981`, `#0EA5E9`, or `#EC4899` — those are old brand colors
- ❌ Never import Space Grotesk
- ❌ Never save new-brand files outside `NewUnera/`
- ❌ Never hardcode hex values that have a token equivalent
